    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Tableau de bord — Anthropic Economic Index\"\nformat:\n  dashboard:\n    orientation: rows\n    scrolling: true\n    nav-buttons:\n      - icon: github\n        href: https://github.com/albanpjy/aei-analyse\n        aria-label: Dépôt GitHub\n    theme:\n      light: [cosmo, ../theme/clair.scss]\n      dark: [cosmo, ../theme/sombre.scss]\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n---\n\n\n\n# Vue d'ensemble\n\n## Row {height=22%}\n\n\n::: {.cell content='valuebox' title='Indice d\\'usage par habitant — France'}\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n$icon\n[1] \"person-workspace\"\n\n$color\n[1] \"primary\"\n\n$value\n[1] \"1,51\"\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell content='valuebox' title='Rang mondial de la France (indice par habitant)'}\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n$icon\n[1] \"trophy\"\n\n$color\n[1] \"secondary\"\n\n$value\n[1] \"9e / 30\"\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell content='valuebox' title='Part d\\'automatisation (Claude.ai, monde)'}\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n$icon\n[1] \"robot\"\n\n$color\n[1] \"warning\"\n\n$value\n[1] \"24,6 %\"\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell content='valuebox' title='Pays dans la dernière version'}\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n$icon\n[1] \"globe\"\n\n$color\n[1] \"info\"\n\n$value\n[1] 30\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Row {height=78%}\n\n### Column {width=60%}\n\n\n::: {.cell title='Indice d\\'usage par habitant dans le monde (dernière version)'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"echarts4r html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-b8ad311434b6c6e2828e\" style=\"width:100%;height:500px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b8ad311434b6c6e2828e\">{\"x\":{\"theme\":\"\",\"tl\":false,\"draw\":true,\"renderer\":\"canvas\",\"events\":[],\"buttons\":[],\"opts\":{\"series\":[{\"type\":\"map\",\"map\":\"world\",\"name\":\"Indice par habitant\",\"data\":[{\"value\":31.49,\"name\":\"Italy\"},{\"value\":24.12,\"name\":\"Spain\"},{\"value\":11.84,\"name\":\"Korea\"},{\"value\":6.31,\"name\":\"Australia\"},{\"value\":3.14,\"name\":\"United States\"},{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Argentina\"},{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"India\"},{\"value\":2.47,\"name\":\"Finland\"},{\"value\":1.51,\"name\":\"France\"},{\"value\":1.44,\"name\":\"Namibia\"},{\"value\":1.42,\"name\":\"Portugal\"},{\"value\":1.38,\"name\":\"Mexico\"},{\"value\":1.03,\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"value\":1.01,\"name\":\"Belgium\"},{\"value\":0.9,\"name\":\"Netherlands\"},{\"value\":0.88,\"name\":\"Denmark\"},{\"value\":0.83,\"name\":\"Germany\"},{\"value\":0.83,\"name\":\"Canada\"},{\"value\":0.83,\"name\":\"Switzerland\"},{\"value\":0.8,\"name\":\"Israel\"},{\"value\":0.79,\"name\":\"Japan\"},{\"value\":0.5,\"name\":\"Norway\"},{\"value\":0.49,\"name\":\"Ireland\"},{\"value\":0.35,\"name\":\"Brazil\"},{\"value\":0.32,\"name\":\"South Africa\"},{\"value\":0.2,\"name\":\"Sweden\"},{\"value\":0.16,\"name\":\"Austria\"},{\"value\":0.15,\"name\":\"Singapore\"},{\"value\":0.11,\"name\":\"Poland\"},{\"value\":0.08,\"name\":\"New Zealand\"}]}],\"visualMap\":[{\"inRange\":{\"color\":[\"#cde2fb\",\"#9ec5f4\",\"#6da7ec\",\"#3987e5\",\"#256abf\",\"#184f95\",\"#0d366b\"]},\"text\":[\"élevé\",\"faible\"],\"calculable\":true,\"type\":\"continuous\",\"min\":0.08,\"max\":31.49}],\"tooltip\":{\"trigger\":\"item\",\"formatter\":\"function(p){ return p.name + ' : ' + (isNaN(p.value) ? 'non publié' : p.value.toLocaleString('fr-FR')); }\"}},\"dispose\":true},\"evals\":[\"opts.tooltip.formatter\"],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Column {width=40%}\n\n\n::: {.cell title='Classement (indice par habitant)'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-b8980f842be5f5193f9b\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b8980f842be5f5193f9b\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"Pays\":[\"Italie\",\"Espagne\",\"South Korea\",\"Australia\",\"États-Unis\",\"Argentina\",\"India\",\"Finland\",\"France\",\"Namibia\",\"Portugal\",\"Mexico\",\"Royaume-Uni\",\"Belgique\",\"Pays-Bas\",\"Denmark\",\"Allemagne\",\"Canada\",\"Switzerland\",\"Israel\",\"Japan\",\"Norway\",\"Ireland\",\"Brazil\",\"South Africa\",\"Sweden\",\"Austria\",\"Singapore\",\"Poland\",\"New Zealand\"],\"Indice\":[31.49,24.12,11.84,6.31,3.14,3,3,2.47,1.51,1.44,1.42,1.38,1.03,1.01,0.9,0.88,0.83,0.83,0.83,0.8,0.79,0.5,0.49,0.35,0.32,0.2,0.16,0.15,0.11,0.08],\"Part de l'usage (%)\":[6.06,3.95,5.46,5.03,0.48,5,6.12,1.67,4.6,8.04,5.34,7.34,2.6,2.44,3.66,2.81,4.77,1.49,4.37,4.5,4.22,3.27,1.62,0.75,0.59,1.13,0.89,0.95,0.58,0.29]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"Pays\",\"name\":\"Pays\",\"type\":\"character\"},{\"id\":\"Indice\",\"name\":\"Indice\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"cell\":\"function(cell){ const w = Math.min(100, cell.value * 25);\\n      return '<div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\\\"><div style=\\\"background:#2a78d6;height:9px;width:' + w + 'px;border-radius:2px\\\"><\\/div>' + cell.value.toLocaleString('fr-FR') + '<\\/div>'; }\",\"html\":true},{\"id\":\"Part de l'usage (%)\",\"name\":\"Part de l'usage (%)\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"format\":{\"cell\":{\"locales\":\"fr-FR\"},\"aggregated\":{\"locales\":\"fr-FR\"}}}],\"searchable\":true,\"defaultPageSize\":12,\"highlight\":true,\"compact\":true,\"language\":{\"filterPlaceholder\":\"Filtrer…\",\"searchPlaceholder\":\"Rechercher…\",\"searchLabel\":\"Rechercher\",\"noData\":\"Aucune ligne\",\"pageNext\":\"Suivant\",\"pagePrevious\":\"Précédent\",\"pageNumbers\":\"{page} sur {pages}\",\"pageInfo\":\"{rowStart}–{rowEnd} sur {rows} lignes\",\"pageSizeOptions\":\"Afficher {rows}\",\"groupExpandLabel\":\"Déplier le groupe\",\"selectAllRowsLabel\":\"Tout sélectionner\",\"selectRowLabel\":\"Sélectionner la ligne\"},\"dataKey\":\"ed8aaf8c7c8c45bea3cb2391524a8b8a\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[\"tag.attribs.columns.1.cell\"],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Pays (interactif)\n\n## {.sidebar}\n\n```{ojs}\n//| echo: false\n// Liste SQL des pays choisis. Les codes viennent de la liste proposée (valeurs\n// sûres) ; on évite de lier un tableau JS comme paramètre, mal pris en charge\n// par certaines versions de DuckDB-WASM.\nliste_sql = (codes) => codes.map(c => `'${String(c).replace(/'/g, \"''\")}'`).join(\", \") || \"''\"\n// DuckDB-WASM : une base DuckDB complète, exécutée DANS le navigateur, qui lit\n// les fichiers Parquet publiés avec le site. Aucun serveur.\ndb = DuckDBClient.of({\n  usage: FileAttachment(\"../donnees_publiees/usage_pays.parquet\"),\n  automatisation: FileAttachment(\"../donnees_publiees/automatisation.parquet\"),\n  soc: FileAttachment(\"../donnees_publiees/soc_pays.parquet\"),\n  taches: FileAttachment(\"../donnees_publiees/taches.parquet\"),\n  pays: FileAttachment(\"../donnees_publiees/pays.parquet\")\n})\nversions = (await db.query(\"SELECT DISTINCT release FROM usage ORDER BY release\")).map(d => d.release)\nliste_pays = (await db.query(`SELECT DISTINCT u.geo_id, coalesce(p.country_name, u.geo_id) AS nom\n  FROM usage u LEFT JOIN pays p ON p.iso_alpha_3 = u.geo_id ORDER BY nom`))\nviewof version = Inputs.select(versions, {label: \"Version de l'index\", value: versions[versions.length - 1]})\nviewof choix_pays = Inputs.select(new Map(liste_pays.map(d => [d.nom, d.geo_id])), {\n  label: \"Pays (Ctrl/Cmd pour plusieurs)\", multiple: true, size: 10,\n  value: [\"FRA\", \"DEU\", \"GBR\", \"ESP\", \"ITA\", \"BEL\", \"NLD\", \"USA\"]\n})\n```\n\n::: {.callout-note appearance=\"minimal\"}\nFiltres calculés dans votre navigateur par **DuckDB-WASM** sur les fichiers Parquet du\nsite. Données d'**usage** de Claude, pas d'emploi.\n:::\n\n## Row\n\n```{ojs}\n//| title: \"Indice d'usage par habitant (version choisie)\"\naui = db.query(`SELECT u.geo_id, coalesce(p.country_name, u.geo_id) AS nom, avg(u.aui) AS aui,\n  any_value(u.origine_aui) AS origine\n  FROM usage u LEFT JOIN pays p ON p.iso_alpha_3 = u.geo_id\n  WHERE u.release = ? AND u.geo_id IN (${liste_sql(choix_pays)})\n  GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY aui DESC`, [version])\nPlot.plot({\n  marginLeft: 130, height: Math.max(220, 26 * aui.length), x: {label: \"Indice (1 = proportionnel à la population 15–64 ans)\", grid: true},\n  y: {label: null},\n  marks: [\n    Plot.barX(aui, {y: \"nom\", x: \"aui\", sort: {y: \"-x\"}, rx: 2,\n      fill: d => palette[d.geo_id] ?? \"#c3c2b7\", tip: true,\n      title: d => `${d.nom}\\nIndice : ${d.aui.toLocaleString(\"fr-FR\", {maximumFractionDigits: 2})} (${d.origine})`}),\n    Plot.ruleX([1], {stroke: \"#898781\", strokeDasharray: \"4,3\"})\n  ]\n})\n```\n\n```{ojs}\n//| title: \"Part d'automatisation (Claude.ai), toutes versions\"\nauto = db.query(`SELECT a.release, a.geo_id, coalesce(p.country_name, a.geo_id) AS nom,\n  avg(a.automatisation_pct) AS auto\n  FROM automatisation a LEFT JOIN pays p ON p.iso_alpha_3 = a.geo_id\n  WHERE a.source = 'claude_ai' AND a.geo_level = 'country'\n    AND a.geo_id IN (${liste_sql(choix_pays)})\n  GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY a.release`)\nPlot.plot({\n  height: 320, x: {type: \"point\", label: \"Version\"}, y: {label: \"Automatisation (%)\", grid: true},\n  color: {legend: true, domain: [...new Set(auto.map(d => d.nom))],\n          range: [...new Set(auto.map(d => d.geo_id))].map(g => palette[g] ?? \"#898781\")},\n  marks: [\n    Plot.line(auto, {x: \"release\", y: \"auto\", stroke: \"nom\", strokeWidth: 2}),\n    Plot.dot(auto, {x: \"release\", y: \"auto\", fill: \"nom\", r: 4, tip: true,\n      title: d => `${d.nom} — ${d.release}\\n${d.auto.toLocaleString(\"fr-FR\", {maximumFractionDigits: 1})} %`})\n  ]\n})\n```\n\n## Row\n\n```{ojs}\n//| title: \"Tâches les plus fréquentes (premier pays sélectionné, version choisie)\"\ntaches = db.query(`SELECT tache, part_pct FROM taches\n  WHERE release = ? AND geo_id = ? ORDER BY part_pct DESC LIMIT 15`, [version, choix_pays[0] ?? \"FRA\"])\nInputs.table(taches, {\n  columns: [\"tache\", \"part_pct\"],\n  header: {tache: \"Tâche O*NET\", part_pct: \"Part (%)\"},\n  format: {part_pct: d => d.toLocaleString(\"fr-FR\", {maximumFractionDigits: 2})},\n  width: {tache: 520}, rows: 15\n})\n```\n\n# Automatisation\n\n## Row\n\n\n::: {.cell title='Automatisation mondiale par version et par source (survol pour le détail)'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"plotly html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-a52845f347d241738093\" style=\"width:100%;height:406px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a52845f347d241738093\">{\"x\":{\"data\":[{\"x\":[3,4,5,6],\"y\":[42.80515900790067,88.545583732771007,32.363977530144453,45.314701737905125],\"text\":[\"API — 2025-09-15<br>42,8 %\",\"API — 2026-01-15<br>88,5 %\",\"API — 2026-03-24<br>32,4 %\",\"API — 2026-06-26<br>45,3 %\"],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"lines+markers\",\"line\":{\"width\":3.0236220472440949,\"color\":\"rgba(27,175,122,1)\",\"dash\":\"solid\"},\"hoveron\":\"points\",\"name\":\"API\",\"legendgroup\":\"API\",\"showlegend\":true,\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"hoverinfo\":\"text\",\"marker\":{\"autocolorscale\":false,\"color\":\"rgba(27,175,122,1)\",\"opacity\":1,\"size\":9.4488188976377963,\"symbol\":\"circle\",\"line\":{\"width\":1.8897637795275593,\"color\":\"rgba(27,175,122,1)\"}},\"frame\":null},{\"x\":[1,2,3,4,5,6],\"y\":[38.56363353206482,42.415770104358266,14.458417639875773,73.175497000774442,76.475448064099339,24.579853593153935],\"text\":[\"Claude.ai — 2025-02-10<br>38,6 %\",\"Claude.ai — 2025-03-27<br>42,4 %\",\"Claude.ai — 2025-09-15<br>14,5 %\",\"Claude.ai — 2026-01-15<br>73,2 %\",\"Claude.ai — 2026-03-24<br>76,5 %\",\"Claude.ai — 2026-06-26<br>24,6 %\"],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"lines+markers\",\"line\":{\"width\":3.0236220472440949,\"color\":\"rgba(42,120,214,1)\",\"dash\":\"solid\"},\"hoveron\":\"points\",\"name\":\"Claude.ai\",\"legendgroup\":\"Claude.ai\",\"showlegend\":tru